# the autosave (drones stopped): once, after the last change has settled, not on every step of a glide.
# A preset picked with a long scene switch (Setup 1 KNOB 3 at 70, ~27 s) once wrote the flash 660 times in
# 20 s on the FM-1 (Evan, 2026-10-19), each write flickering the lights.
pressure w1 0
set 71 70
wait 6000
expect store_writes 0
tapkey w1
wait 20000
# still gliding: nothing written yet
expect store_writes 0
wait 15000
# settled (and 4 s quiet): one write
expect store_writes 1
wait 10000
expect store_writes 1
